        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-06-23T17:21:26.883Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Thunderbird\" data-post=\"23\" data-topic=\"29363\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Thunderbird:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Werewolves with frikkin’ lasers!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not quite, what I am saying is that werewolves <em>are</em> frikkin’ lasers! Because SCIENCE!</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/skywhale\">@skywhale</a> Yes, those are good questions… Maybe they aren’t emitting a beam. It’d be a real shame if a werewolf laser beam hit any passing cosmic entities…</p>",
