      {
        "id": 245580,
        "name": "Sea-Envy",
        "username": "Sea-Envy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-06-24T08:27:51.682Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I had a thought. Threre was a “cosmic dust storm” wrecking the world but enough plants, animals, and humans survived that it was not an extinction event.<br>\nIt was Akashbuta, she flashed back to the dinosaur extinction event and used her energy to keep life on Earth.</p>\n<p>Frost Bite yelling at Paul for going full on evil because of one little curse makes me think Setback would be one of the first vampires to join his faction. I also figure Pete’s luck +/- powers would also cause humans near him to “accidentally” die so he would have access to blood but not personally kill or make new vampires.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
