        "created_at": "2026-01-09T15:37:13.244Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Vampire unity is the same as regular unity, except her power signature is red instead of pink.</p>\n<p>The city should lean into the gothic vibe and be called Mega Therion.</p>\n<p>“a thing from another hero or villain”…like Bugbear’s Bloodstone perhaps?</p>\n<p>Christopher is absolutely correct.  Garlic is wonderful…I particularly like the little jars of minced garlic.</p>",
